{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your companions weren't sure how you would manage running a shop in the busiest part of town - that is, until you all stumbled across the Lost Crucible, a magic realm where crafting is king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft Together, Online or Locally</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keeping up with the demands of legions of customers is hard work. Grab your friends and work together to fulfill as many orders as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Fungai_run.gif?t=1746121945\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Bunny_2_apron_run.gif?t=1746121945\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Dwarf_2_running.gif?t=1746121945\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Blue_2_apron_run.gif?t=1746121945\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather Resources from Around the Map</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your customers are adventurer's, and they need all sorts of weapons, armors, and items. Luckily, the Lost Crucible has everything you need. Chop trees, mine for ore, forage for ingredients, and defeat enemies to craft what your buyers want and need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Materials_sheet.png?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/ticket_items_spritesheet.png?t=1746121945\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use Equipment to Enhance Your Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and bring equipment into Lost Crucible to help you craft even faster. Bat wings for increased aerial mobility, portable mushrooms to bounce you into the air, and a magical cape to quickly teleport forward are just some of the tools you will use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Batwingsflap.gif?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Personal_mush_bounce.gif?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Dash_cape.png?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Metal_boots.png?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Drawn Pixel Art in a Whimsical Fantasy World\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the different locations the Lost Crucible has to offer, from the ancient castle ruins to the dangerous lava caves, all in the company of magical workstations and strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Cockatrice.gif?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Eye_bat.gif?t=1746121945\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675320?t=1746121945","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/b6518d2c60468c061dda4c5d8c5b06ffcd38771d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746121945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/2c314ec7fb92e5315ffce75efab47e08d20f87b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746121945","capsule_