op trees, mine for ore, forage for ingredients, and defeat enemies to craft what your buyers want and need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Materials_sheet.png?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/ticket_items_spritesheet.png?t=1746121945\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use Equipment to Enhance Your Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and bring equipment into Lost Crucible to help you craft even faster. Bat wings for increased aerial mobility, portable mushrooms to bounce you into the air, and a magical cape to quickly teleport forward are just some of the tools you will use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Batwingsflap.gif?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Personal_mush_bounce.gif?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Dash_cape.png?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Metal_boots.png?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Drawn Pixel Art in a Whimsical Fantasy World\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the different locations the Lost Crucible has to offer, from the ancient castle ruins to the dangerous lava caves, all in the company of magical workstations and strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Cockatrice.gif?t=1746121945\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/extras/Eye_bat.gif?t=1746121945\" /></p>","developers":["Wigwub Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/6dd124335433551a0ac627d32dc43277ec92e9f4/header.jpg?t=1746121945","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Lost Crucible","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Intel Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 9.0c</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Wigwub Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/911b812a31090976f8b803bbc9da16796ef3fc1d/ss_911b812a31090976f8b803bbc9da16796ef3fc1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746121945","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/911b812a31090976f8b803bbc9da16796ef3fc1d/ss_911b812a31090976f8b803bbc9da16796ef3fc1d.600x338.jpg?t=1746121945"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675320/3d1ba16c732ae6354ea5c3e220d19bd8f560